Package: pkimaster
Architecture: all
Depends: ${misc:Depends}, python3 (>= 3.11), python3-flask (>= 3.1), python3-cryptography (>= 43), python3-werkzeug (>= 3.1), gunicorn (>= 23), adduser
Description: web-managed public key infrastructure service
 Run one Root, Intermediate or Issuing CA per server through an HTTPS
 console with mandatory MFA, independent subordinate CA approval,
 role-based access, audit logging and certificate revocation.
 All application configuration is performed in the
 web console. The service initially listens on https://127.0.0.1:8443.
 .
 Certificate authority keys and application state are retained on removal
 and purge to prevent accidental destruction of the public key infrastructure.
